# Everything at this level is ignored by default, and only the application is
# tracked. This is a deliberate allow-list, not an ignore-list: the same directory
# holds firmware images, Ghidra projects, packet captures, a JDK and the reverse
# engineering notes, and any future folder added here must be allowed on purpose
# rather than remembered by whoever writes the next rule.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/NightStalkerCompanion/

# Build output and IDE state
[Bb]in/
[Oo]bj/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
*.user
*.suo
*.userprefs

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Test and coverage output
[Tt]est[Rr]esult*/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml
coverage*.json
coverage*.xml
